Description: unofficial community CLI for Aura Frames digital photo frames
 pushframe syncs a local photo folder or a Google Photos album onto an Aura
 digital photo frame through its own local pipeline: content-hash dedupe,
 hide-by-default mirror semantics, a pruned download cache with a persistent
 manifest, and an anti-abuse paced write path.
 .
 The package embeds its own Python 3.14 runtime (no system Python is used or
 modified); amd64-only for that reason.
 .
 Unofficial community tool — not affiliated with or endorsed by Aura Frames
 Inc. Originally a fork of zmanowar's auraframes; see the project README for
 provenance.

